      <description>&lt;p&gt;Currently, I am a Software Developer at Google working on Google Cloud. I am also an open-source developer, a maintainer of &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/Qiskit/rustworkx&#34;&gt;rustworkx&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Previously, I was a student at &lt;a href=&#34;https://omscs.gatech.edu/&#34;&gt;Georgia Tech&amp;rsquo;s OMSCS&lt;/a&gt; through Google&amp;rsquo;s education reimbursement program. Before that, I studied at the University of British Columbia, where I wrote my &lt;a href=&#34;https://doi.org/10.14288/1.0417515&#34;&gt;Honours Thesis&lt;/a&gt; under the supervision of &lt;a href=&#34;https://cmps-people.ok.ubc.ca/rlawrenc/&#34;&gt;Dr. Ramon Lawrence&lt;/a&gt;. My research focused on databases, particularly on Learned Indexes.&lt;/p&gt;
